    "messages": [
        {
            "id": "a003_200_0000",
            "en_US": [
                "Cheren: Well... Still.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Is there anything more important\n",
                "than strength for Trainers,{VAR BE00}\n",
                "like the Champion said?{VAR BE01}"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_200_0001",
            "en_US": [
                "Oh, I'll never understand just by\n",
                "thinking about it.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "What a bother.\n",
                "Let's hurry up and check the inside."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_200_0002",
            "en_US": "Cheren: Oh... Is someone in there?"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_200_0003",
            "en_US": "Shall we go, then?"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_200_0004",
            "en_US": [
                "But the only place in the Cold Storage\n",
                "we haven't searched is here, right?"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_200_0005",
            "en_US": [
                "What's wrong?\n",
                "Aren't you going to check the inside?"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_200_0006",
            "en_US": [
                "When you walk through the containers,\n",
                "some places are frozen, so you go{VAR BE00}\n",
                "sliding around!"
            ]
        },
